# README media: HELLSPUR. The title and the burning saloon from a new game;
# the rest is set up with cheats and played by the demo player's real
# button presses. The GIF is the posse in the Sweetgrass, a wisp catching
# them, and a fight on the timing bar.
shotscale 2
seed 40
game hellspur
wait 60
shot hellspur_title
press A
wait 25
press A
wait 25
press A
wait 25
press A
wait 25
press A
wait 20
shot hellspur_saloon
# the Sweetgrass, a wisp closing in, and the fight
cheat posse 0 5 2 1
cheat level 0 6
cheat level 5 6
cheat level 2 6
cheat level 1 6
cheat equip 0 0 35
cheat spawns 0
cheat warp 0 22 76
cheat wisp 30 74
cheat wisp 26 80
gifstart hellspur 3 1
hold RIGHT 20
wait 4
hold RIGHT 20
wait 4
hold RIGHT 20
wait 30
botplay 900
gifstop
# Meridian
cheat warp 4 16 13
wait 20
shot hellspur_town
# through the saloon door: the bar, the stage and the piano
cheat warp 4 29 5
cheat face 1
press UP
wait 20
hold UP 30
hold LEFT 10
wait 20
shot hellspur_room
# a boss on the timing bar: the Saguaro Mother
cheat level 0 30
cheat level 5 30
cheat level 2 30
cheat level 1 30
cheat god
cheat warp 33 -1 0
cheat battle 93
botuntil b_phase == 8 2000
botplay 22
shot hellspur_bar
# the last fight
cheat level 0 45
cheat level 5 45
cheat level 2 45
cheat level 1 45
cheat warp 40 -1 0
cheat battle 100
botplay 70
shot hellspur_final
cheat mortal
# the nightmares over the Territory
cheat posse 0 5 2 1
cheat key 10
cheat warp 0 84 60
cheat mount 2
hold UP 40
wait 3
shot hellspur_fly
